graph TD
    User[User] --> UI(Streamlit chat UI)

    subgraph Offline ingestion
        PDFs[Statute PDFs<br/>BNS · BNSS · IPC · CrPC] --> Parser(legal_parser.py<br/>sections + metadata)
        Parser --> Chunker(Section-aware chunks<br/>+ context header)
        Chunker --> Embed(FastEmbed<br/>BGE dense + BM25 sparse)
        Embed --> Qdrant[(Qdrant<br/>indian_law_v2)]
        MapPDF[Official correspondence tables] --> Map[(data/section_map.csv)]
    end

    UI --> QA(Query analysis<br/>refs · IPC↔BNS map · translate)
    QA --> Map
    QA --> Exact(Exact section lookup)
    QA --> Hybrid(Hybrid search<br/>dense + BM25, RRF)
    Exact --> Qdrant
    Hybrid --> Qdrant
    Hybrid --> Rerank(Cross-encoder rerank)
    Exact --> Gen
    Rerank --> Abstain{score ≥ threshold?}
    Abstain -- no --> UI
    Abstain -- yes --> Gen(Grounded generation<br/>Ollama · cites S#/W#)
    Web(Indian Kanoon / Serper<br/>optional) --> Gen
    Gen --> Verify(Citation verifier<br/>links · unsupported · non-existent)
    Verify --> UI

    UI -. agentic mode .-> Crew(CrewAI researcher + writer)
    Crew --> Exact
    Crew --> Hybrid
    Crew --> Web
    Crew --> Verify

    style Qdrant fill:#ffc,stroke:#333
    style Map fill:#ffc,stroke:#333
    style Gen fill:#fcc,stroke:#333
    style Verify fill:#cfc,stroke:#333
    style Crew fill:#fcf,stroke:#333
